# Client data never belongs in git: IC summaries, Mozaik jobs and fixtures stay local.
/.local-fixtures/
/data/
/logs/
/out/
# Jim's answers name jobs, so no copy of them is ever committed, whatever its name or format.
# docs/p0 tracks only its three blank documents; anything else there stays out, and so does a
# copy of the questionnaire anywhere else (code aside; a new blank questionnaire needs its own
# ! line). No rule protects a tracked file: never save his answers over the blank one.
/docs/p0/*
!/docs/p0/access-request.md
!/docs/p0/questionnaire-jim.md
!/docs/p0/setup-check.md
*questionnaire*
!*questionnaire*.py
!/docs/p0/questionnaire-jim.md
# Python
/.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
/build/
/dist/
*.egg-info/
# Atomic-write temp files
*.part
*.ngr-tmp
